        <mxCell id="c103" value="149 of 851 records found" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="320" width="860" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c104" value="&lt;i&gt;Filtered to the entries whose ReversesJournalEntryID is filled; the first 10 of 149 are shown, all of type Accrual Adjustment. Columns E, G, I and J (Description, the creator and the approver) are hidden. CreatedDate&#x27;s number format is changed to yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss (the workbook shows it as a date). Outlined: CreatedDate, whose time, 08:00:00 on every row, is when the entry was created, not when it was posted, and ReversesJournalEntryID, the JournalEntryID of the earlier accrual that the entry adjusts. Blue row numbers mark a filtered Table.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="352" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
